l":"https://api.github.com/users/o1xhack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o1xhack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o1xhack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o1xhack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":90774554,"digest":"sha256:5db63fe39fd82da043d28243a477f4cc452e1b467e68c6db235a5582790ea0c0","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-22T04:43:57Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:44:04Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/o1xhack/CodexBar-Mobile/releases/download/v0.79.0.1-mobile.3.1.0/CodexBar-0.79.0.1-mobile.3.1.0.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o1xhack/CodexBar-Mobile/tarball/v0.79.0.1-mobile.3.1.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o1xhack/CodexBar-Mobile/zipball/v0.79.0.1-mobile.3.1.0","body":"### Highlights — Mobile 3.1.0\n- Sync upstream v0.77.0–v0.79.0 in one release: Future AGI and Munito, Gemini app quotas, Claude desktop/tcr accounts, safer local-only Agent Sessions, and lower CPU, memory and cost-cache disk I/O.\n- Keep existing Codex history and checkpoints when upgrading the fork cost cache; keep account-specific Claude local history on the Mac so it cannot contaminate the iPhone’s combined history.\n- Sync cached claude-swap/tcr account quotas and plugin warning details to iPhone through the existing Production payload. Keep Gemini app five-hour and weekly window names distinct from CLI model quotas, with device-scoped Web identities to preserve different accounts across Macs. The companion iOS 3.1.0 update includes the existing iPhone Duo layouts and calendar features.\n\n### Distribution\n- Consolidates upstream v0.77.0–v0.79.0 into one fork release.\n- Mac: universal arm64/x86_64, signed and notarized; Sparkle 172.1.3.1.0; CloudKit Production, no schema deployment required.\n- iOS companion: 3.1.0 (246), uploaded and processed VALID; submitted for App Review with manual public release.\n- Preserves the iPhone Duo layouts and calendar features from 3.0.0.\n\nArtifact source: `15fb91b1f34d15b79899f258de035687b16287bb` (PR #199 clean review); upstream-sync merge: `1b8a8be12a251b322e8467fe3966250bcb0a3d00`; reviewed release-gate/tooling merge: `e64152322fa63732b38dd6c1b832879bdc4943fe` (PRs #200 and #201). Mac product inputs are identical across these commits.\n"}